        "cooked": "<p>Is Sonvar ok? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/thinking.png?v=12\" title=\":thinking:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":thinking:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-313-writers-room-mystery-comics-vol-2-106\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-313-writers-room-mystery-comics-vol-2-106\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img width=\"250\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/ca864864fd4764e914bcab3670be2db68d1c0662.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" data-dominant-color=\"938C83\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-313-writers-room-mystery-comics-vol-2-106\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Episode #313 - Writer's Room: Mystery Comics Vol. 2 #106</a></h3>\n\n  <p>We don't want to bug you, so please bear with us...  Show Notes: 1:48:49 Adam and I kick it off with talking about how we haven't done a good job with Bugbear... and the ultimate result by the end of the episode is this cover, so, take that as you...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/ce4dde348b881bc658bf701fcbcab744c26d84c5.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/ce4dde348b881bc658bf701fcbcab744c26d84c5\" title=\"e313_1984-09_Mystery_Comics_Vol._2_106\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/ce4dde348b881bc658bf701fcbcab744c26d84c5_2_322x500.jpeg\" alt=\"e313_1984-09_Mystery_Comics_Vol._2_106\" data-base62-sha1=\"tr3bNye4aHm5bri6RNPvwTaeF1j\" width=\"322\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/ce4dde348b881bc658bf701fcbcab744c26d84c5_2_322x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/ce4dde348b881bc658bf701fcbcab744c26d84c5_2_483x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/ce4dde348b881bc658bf701fcbcab744c26d84c5_2_644x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"959797\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">e313_1984-09_Mystery_Comics_Vol._2_106</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×2977 1.27 MB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
