      {
        "id": 262907,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2025-03-27T02:08:14.665Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So glad I started writing my reaction notes in a document I can save!</p>\n<p>Oh yeah, if they start off talking about how they haven’t done a good job with Bugbear and the end result is this cover? The voters got their money’s worth all right. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Yeah, I swear Daylight Savings has really taken it out of me, I still feel bad!</p>\n<p>All games are Side Quest: The Game until you decide to follow the main plot. <em>Like a fool.</em></p>\n<p>Wow, imagine listening to the Letters Page Podcast, the podcast where Christopher and Adam talk about Sentinel Comics! Who would do <em>that?</em></p>\n<p>Aha, they don’t play favorites, but they <em>will</em> play un-favorites! We’ve got 'em, boys!</p>\n<p>Outside of reality, whoop! There goes gravity!</p>\n<p>“Go silly hats only on him” is the funniest way to describe that scene XD</p>\n<p>Bugbear as protagonist only makes sense, this <em>is</em> “a Bugbear story”, after all.</p>\n<p>Ah yes, Bugbear’s greatest sin, not being a good friend.</p>\n<p>“In an alternate reality, that’s my name, too!” How many people can really say that? Both in terms of having an AU version of themselves with someone else’s codename and also knowing it’s true. XD</p>\n<p>Episode 500: The Letters Page Definitive Edition</p>\n<p>Wow, this letter writer is op af.</p>\n<p>It is surreal hearing “bear with wasp wings and stinger” from Sentinels of the Multiverse creator Christopher Badell when I very specifically changed that card so it is not in fact that very thing. XD</p>\n<p>And the Argent Artist could draw them like one of his fringe cases.</p>\n<p>oh, hey, it me! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=12\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Good to hear there is sometimes planning in these fake comic books!</p>\n<p>The help we needed is in fact the friends we found along the way!</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
